    words text_0532, 0, 5                 ; 9.1 shopping cost a fifth of its money or more: ★ I'd like a store like this too, / beep
    words text_054F, 0, 5                 ; 9.2 shopping cost a fifth of its money or more: Beep, what's this place? / Looks like a pricey store, beep?
    words text_0578, 3, 6                 ; 10.0 shopping: got the money back: Let's keep this a secret, / beep ♪
    words text_0597, 3, 6                 ; 10.1 shopping: got the money back: Cash back / makes me happy, beep ♪
    words text_05BE, 3, 6                 ; 10.2 shopping: got the money back: A crazy good deal, beep
