text_01E6:
    string "Don't step on the monitor, beep"  ; ja: モニター踏むなピピッ

text_01FB:
    string "Getting my show canceled is%Ksuch a shame, beep ≦"  ; ja: 番組打ち切りは無念だピピッ≦

text_0218:
    string "Click!! (turns off)"          ; ja: プツン！！

text_0223:
    string "Let's run flashy commercials,%Kbeep ♪"  ; ja: 派手にＣＭを流そうピピッ♪

text_023E:
    string "Now everything's ready, beep ♪"  ; ja: これで準備はバンタンさピピッ♪

text_025D:
    string "Maybe I'll put up an ad balloon%Kto advertise, beep ★"  ; ja: アドバルーンをあげて%K宣伝しようかなっピピッ★

text_028C:
    string "I'll advertise with newspaper%Kinserts, beep"  ; ja: 折り込みチラシで宣伝するピピッ

text_02AB:
    string "Maybe a little bigger would be%Kbetter, beep"  ; ja: もうちょっと大きいといいかなピピッ

text_02CE:
    string "Can I double the sales, beep?"  ; ja: 売り上げ倍増できるのかピピッ？

text_02ED:
    string "Beep, that's the end of today's%Kbroadcast"  ; ja: ピピッ今日は放送終わりマース

text_030A:
    string "Delivery date not set.. beep ♪"  ; ja: 入荷日は未定・・だピピッ♪

text_0325:
    string "If I don't rest sometimes I'll%Kbreak, beep"  ; ja: たまには休まないと壊れちゃうピピッ

text_0348:
    string "I'll buy it all up while I can,%Kbeep"  ; ja: 今のうちに買い占めるピピッ

text_0363:
    string "I want some electromagnetic wave%Kprotection gear, beep ★"  ; ja: 電磁波防止グッズが欲しいピピッ★

text_0384:
    string "If I don't hurry it'll sell out,%Kbeep ≦"  ; ja: 早くしないと売りきれちゃうピピッ≦

text_03A7:
    string "For electromagnetic goods, come to%Kour store, beep"  ; ja: 電磁波グッズは当店までーピピッ

text_03C6:
    string "The mobile street TV,%K%NMY, is here, beep"  ; ja: 移動式街頭テレビ%K%NMYはここにいるピピッ

text_03EF:
    string "%NMY's store is bursting%Kwith electromagnetic waves, beep"  ; ja: %NMYのお店は%K電磁波出まくりピピッ

text_0412:
    string "Not getting on, beep ♪"     ; ja: のらないピピッ♪

text_0423:
    string "It's a detour, beep!"       ; ja: 遠回りになるピピッ！

text_0438:
    string "I'll watch some rakugo, beep ♪"  ; ja: 落語でも見てるピピッ♪

text_044F:
    string "I withdrew my meager pay, beep"  ; ja: なけなしの給料をおろしたピピッ

text_046E:
    string "I'll buy a video camera with this,%Kbeep ★"  ; ja: これでビデオカメラ買うピピッ★

text_048D:
    string "Beep?%KI thought there'd be lots ≦"  ; ja: ピッ？%Kイッパイあると思ったのに≦

text_04B0:
    string "%NMY has just arrived,%Kbeep"  ; ja: %NMYただいま参上だピピッ

text_04C9:
    string "That was suffocating, beep%K(apparently it does breathe)"  ; ja: 息苦しかったピピッ%K（一応息はしてるらしい）

text_04F6:
    string "%NMY is%Knot a suitcase, beep!!"  ; ja: %NMYは%K荷物じゃないピピッ！！

text_0515:
    string "Are you up to something bad,%Kbeep?"  ; ja: 悪いことデモしてるっピピッ？

text_0532:
    string "★ I'd like a store like this too,%Kbeep"  ; ja: ★こんなお店も欲しいなピピッ

text_054F:
    string "Beep, what's this place?%KLooks like a pricey store, beep?"  ; ja: ピピッ何々ここ？%K高そうなお店だピピッ？

text_0578:
    string "Let's keep this a secret,%Kbeep ♪"  ; ja: この事は内緒にしとこうピピッ♪

text_0597:
    string "Cash back%Kmakes me happy, beep ♪"  ; ja: キャッシュバックって%Kうれしいピピッ♪

text_05BE:
    string "A crazy good deal, beep"    ; ja: ムチャクチャ得したっピピッ

text_05D9:
    string "Not feeling well, beep"     ; ja: 調子が悪いピピッ

text_05EA:
    string "Sad, beep ♪"                   ; ja: かなしいピッ♪

text_05F9:
    string "BEEP?!"                     ; ja: ピピッ？！

text_0604:
    string "A journey of a thousand miles%Kstarts with one step, beep"  ; ja: 千里の道も一歩からだピピッ

text_061F:
    string "The owner is a TV ♪ a TV ♪"   ; ja: オーナーはテレビ♪テレビ♪

text_063A:
    string "Make lots of money for me, beep"  ; ja: ばっちり儲けてくれピピッ

text_0653:
    string "Beep? I won't be able to pay the%Klicense fee"  ; ja: ピッ？受信料払えなくなっちゃう

text_0672:
    string "The screen looks like snow,%Kbeep ≦"  ; ja: 画面が砂嵐みたいだピピッ≦

text_068D:
    string "I've got to save money, beep!"  ; ja: 倹約しなくちゃだめっピピッ

text_06A8:
    string "Beep ♪%KLevel up to Clear Vision!"  ; ja: ピピッ♪%Kクリアビジョンにレベルアッープ！

text_06D3:
    string "Beeeep! Halfway reached! A%Kspecial broadcast ☆"  ; ja: ピピー！%K半分達成！記念放送ぉぉぉ☆

text_06F8:
    string "I need higher ratings, beep"  ; ja: もっと視聴率とんなきゃピピッ

text_0715:
    string "Do I really have to sell, beep?"  ; ja: どうしても売らなきゃダメピッ？

text_0734:
    string "...So it's goodbye, beep"   ; ja: ・・・お別れだねピピッ

text_074B:
    string "Beeep ≦ I wish you'd waited a%Klittle longer, beep"  ; ja: ピピィィィ≦%Kもう少しまって欲しかったピピッ

text_0778:
    string "I can't open a store, beep!!"  ; ja: お店を開けないピピッ！！

text_0791:
    string "Lalala ♭ Music show ♪%K(↑ broadcasting a music program)"  ; ja: ラララ♭ミュージーックショー♪%K（↑音楽番組を放送中）

text_07C8:
    string "I'll buy a better place, beep"  ; ja: もっとイイトコ買ってやるピピッ

text_07E7:
    string "I don't feel like buying anything,%Kbeep"  ; ja: なんか買う気がおきないピピッ

text_0804:
    string "Reception is bad here, beep"  ; ja: ここだと受信状態が悪いっピピッ

text_0823:
    string "I don't need this, beep"       ; ja: こんなのいらないピピッ

text_083A:
    string "Horore-chuchupare-ro, beep"  ; ja: ホロレチュチュパレロピピッ

text_0855:
    string "BEEP!"                         ; ja: ピッピ！

text_085E:
    string "A talking TV, beep"            ; ja: しゃべるテレビッピ
    bytes 0x00, 0x00, 0x00    ; padding
